WEBVTT

00:01:59.959 --> 00:02:03.130
like the social insects,
the bees, the ants --

00:02:03.154 --> 00:02:07.726
that can cooperate in large numbers,
but they don't do so flexibly.

00:02:08.099 --> 00:02:10.536
Their cooperation is very rigid.

00:02:11.012 --> 00:02:15.191
There is basically just one way
in which a beehive can function.

00:02:15.215 --> 00:02:19.026
And if there's a new opportunity
or a new danger,

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:23.593
the bees cannot reinvent
the social system overnight.

00:02:23.617 --> 00:02:26.497
They cannot, for example,
execute the queen

00:02:26.521 --> 00:02:28.427
and establish a republic of bees,

00:02:28.451 --> 00:02:31.553
or a communist dictatorship
of worker bees.